<title>USA: Bay View board sets $25 mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Bay View board sets $25 mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bay View Capital Corp said its board authorized the repurchase of another $25 million of its common stock.</p>
<p>Bay View plans to acquire the America First Eureka Holdings Inc unit of America First Financial Fund 1987-A Limited Partnership.</p>
<p>Under terms of the pact, America First Financial Fund would receive $300 million comprised of $210 million in Bay View common stock and $90 million cash, the company said.</p>
<p>Bay View said the board's authorization, combined with the $12 million outstanding on a previous $25 million share authorization, would enable it to buy back about 750,000 additional shares at market prices.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
